Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.45,0:01:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just me and the deck Grandpa\Ngave me against Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus may have captured his soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but his heart has always been\Nright here with me in these cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.93,0:01:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You taught me everything I\Nknow about Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.65,0:01:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,About the rules, strategy, and about\Nstuff you can't learn in any book.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you only remember one\Nthing, Yugi, remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You must never lose faith in\Nyourself if you don't believe you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.43,0:01:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,can win then you'll suffer\Ndefeat not only in dual monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.83,0:01:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me that advice is more\Nvaluable than any card you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever own. I should know. I've\Ncollected the best cards in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And you gave them all to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use them to win Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.87,0:01:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rescue you from Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.71,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.75,0:02:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yug, we all wanted to wish you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.37,0:02:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going all the way, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.71,0:02:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And once it's over, we'll\Nget your grandpa home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.25,0:02:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That means a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.39,0:02:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Would Yugimoto the Challenger\Nplease enter the Duel Ring, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.23,0:02:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus awaits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.95,0:02:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.63,0:02:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks so determined
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,take him down We know you can Put that\Nslime bucket in his place once and for all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The challenger has entered the stadium
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.09,0:03:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,for your dueling pleasure Castle Pegasus\Nis proud to present The creator of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monsters and all its wondrous cards\NAnd thief of my grandfather's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.29,0:03:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The undefeated, undisputed\Nruler of Duelist Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximilian Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.01,0:03:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I finally face Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.37,0:03:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It will take all the wisdom my grandpa\Ngave me and all the power in my cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.23,0:03:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but I will defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, let the duel begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Yugi boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,you've turned out to be\Nquite the young duelist,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,battling your way past\Nall the other challengers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,winning your way into the\Ncastle just to face me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we begin this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.39,0:04:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to agree to keep your\Npromise That if I defeat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll release my grandfather's soul to me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.51,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course, I'm a man of\Nmy word And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.07,0:04:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You must also free the souls\Nof Seto and Mokuba Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.55,0:04:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you hated Kaiba\Nas much as you hate me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Maybe I need to keep\Na vow of my own, Pegasus
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.93,0:04:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You can start by trusting in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And together, we will defeat Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise to Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A vow that I would reunite\Nhim with his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:04:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.35,0:05:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A vow to Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just read my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Yugi boy, if it will put your\Nmind at ease, I agree to your terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you win your battle with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall free these three from\Ntheir lonesome prison of souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.91,0:05:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is up to something. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he planned to take on\NYugi in the final match all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's after something, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.01,0:05:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that Yugi can handle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Throughout the entire tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus has stacked the deck in his\Nown favor every step of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's gonna kick his keister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.13,0:05:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When this is all over, Yugi's going\Nto be the undisputed champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus won't even have\Na clue what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have such a\Nnegative attitude, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's counting on us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But Pegasus has never played fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.45,0:05:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He started by kidnapping Yugi's grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And going into this final match, we don't\Nknow what kind of tricks he'll pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever tricks he tries, whatever\Ncard he plays, Yugi will overcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi hasn't come all this way\Nto lose in the final match.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No way that overdressed prima donna\Nstands a chance against our buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.19,0:06:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Yugi's no Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna beat this clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just about to\Ndraw their first cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head to the upper gallery\Nso we can get a better view.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess there's nothing we can do\Nbut wait for the duel to play out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus holds all the cards right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he holds his prisoners,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,we're going to be at his mercy no\Nmatter what the outcome of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.85,0:06:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.51,0:06:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to see if I can\Nfind Kaiba or Mokuba anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,because if I can get them\Nback, even without their souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then Pegasus won't hold all the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A search for their empty vessels?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.73,0:06:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenger Yugi Moto, as per the rules\Nof the Duelist Kingdom Tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,present the card that\Nentitles you to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.49,0:06:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As per your rules, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Glory of the King's Opposite Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And so the stage is set for the final and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,deciding duel of the\NDuelist Kingdom competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as the card you\Nhold is a blank slate,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.41,0:07:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,there are no limits to the prize you may
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.39,0:07:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,request of your opponent\Nif you are the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can decide if you wish to take over\Nhis company as your reward for winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can ask for this\Nentire island or demand Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.51,0:07:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus' Millennium Eye as your prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tristan wandered off\Nsomewhere by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure where.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.71,0:07:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably just went to\Nthe john. Forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, any request will be honored?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.61,0:07:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's what I call a prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I know how to throw a tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,or do I know how to throw a\Nduelist kingdom tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me that you will free the souls\Nof my grandfather and all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but if I am the one\Nthat defeats you instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.23,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, you have to fulfill\Nyour end of the bargain as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a close look at the card\Nyou hold in your hand, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason that\Nit's blank, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For if I win, I claim your soul forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So you see, you have much to\Ngain, but much to risk as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.37,0:08:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a risk I'm willing to take to free\Nthe soul of my grandpa and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't plan to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We will indeed, Pegasus. So courageous,\Nso defiant. Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yugi loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus will steal his soul too What a\Ncreep But even knowing what's on the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi still isn't going to back down True,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,he's betting his own soul on\Nthe outcome That's our Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd do anything for anybody Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is the biggest gamble I've\Never seen anybody take on Duel Monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.69,0:09:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yugi, you just can't\Nlose. If you did, I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to win You have to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.03,0:09:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to disappoint you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus But I have no intention of ever\Nbecoming part of your sold card collection
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, not only will you become\Na part of my collection,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi But by defeating you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I secure my control of Kaiba\NCorporation And all its inventions
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus has patched us in\Nvia his satellite network.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If he wins against Yugi, we'll\Nbroadcast this nationwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And the publicity will restore our\Ncompany's reputation among duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Our secret alliance with Pegasus will\Npay off at last, very handsomely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All of my plans have come to\Nfruition in this one final duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And if all proceeds as I have envisioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.35,0:09:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's Millennium Puzzle\Nwill soon be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The final duelist contest will now begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner will be declared King of Games!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now both of you cut and\Nshuffle your opponent's cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the cards will be returned,\Nthe scores reset, and... Duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You have come far, Yugi boy,\Nand learned much as I wished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're still a novice compared to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,for I have mastered the\Npower of my Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.83,0:10:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I gotten myself into?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This castle is humongous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is worse than trying to find\Nyour friends down at the mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of Kaiba or\NMokuba or anyone else down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I spoke too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.39,0:11:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to change shifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the little twerp?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.33,0:11:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The same as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Glassy-eyed and glum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry\Nabout him running off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, we still have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Pegasus' pet prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Patch, Matt. I'm out of\Nhere. Catch you later. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on the right track.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, this armor's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd the other guard go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere he could have gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.33,0:12:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What a secret tunnel, but where
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.93,0:12:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,does it lead i feel like we're
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.61,0:12:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,hanging out in the old west waiting\Nfor the first cowboy to draw
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,this is it now we begin\Ni lay one card face down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and throw this monster\Ncard in defense mode
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, sneaky play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't be a\Nbeaver warrior, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Millennium Eye really\Nallowing him to read my cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.55,0:13:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lay one card face down as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then throw this, my own monster card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Red Archery Girl in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to you, Yugi Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Archery Girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he play such a weak\Nmonster in defense mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to draw me into an attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.91,0:13:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Boy, I know all, I see all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.11,0:13:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the cards you have face\Ndown are beaver warrior and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.71,0:13:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,horn of the unicorn in the\Nnext turn you plan to use
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,these two in a combination\Nattack pegasus seems so
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,confident but that's always\Nbeen his style never to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,reveal his true motives his\Ndown card worries me but
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't pass up this chance\Nto gain an early point
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,advantage i have to take\Na chance and strike i
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.65,0:14:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,switched the beaver warrior\Ni had hidden to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And I activate my hidden card,\Nthe Horn of the Unicorn, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Its electricity powers up his sword, raising\NBeaver Warrior's attack power by 700.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, attack the Archery Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.33,0:14:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made a grave mistake, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You've activated my trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.51,0:14:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tears of a Mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.21,0:14:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.53,0:14:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tears of a Mermaid activates the moment an\Nopponent's hidden card is put into play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It blocks all possible attacks\Nby the opponent's monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Beaver Warrior's electric\Nattack backfires against the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.85,0:15:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,beaver itself and its attack\Npower drops to its original value.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it's weaker, I'll switch\Nmy red archery girl to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.97,0:15:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Archery girl, turn that\Nbeaver into roadkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Archery girl, attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Beaver warrior is eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi had the upper hand, but\NPegasus knew exactly how to counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But how could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Pegasus can read minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And why the heck hasn't\NTristan come back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We should all be here supporting Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.37,0:15:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't he realize he's\Nmissing a match at a century?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus must be reading my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.55,0:16:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way he could have been\Nso prepared to counter my cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, Yugi boy is a\Nbeliever. How can I win against
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,an opponent who can know\Nmy cards and sense my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,strategies as soon as I think\Nthem up how indeed I think
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,oh wait I know you're just\Nbeginning to comprehend my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,power do you now realize the\Nmagnitude of the jeopardy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you've put yourself in by\Naccepting this duel how
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,can you defeat not only the\Ncreator of dual monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but It's a duelist who can\Nread your every thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see everything in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.99,0:16:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hopes, your dreams, even your fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And what you fear most right now is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.53,0:16:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And with good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You know my mind reading abilities\Ngive me an unbeatable advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.09,0:16:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.91,0:16:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We all know Yugi can beat\Nanybody in a fair duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but if Pegasus is able to read his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it's what makes his eye one of the\Nmost powerful millennium items.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He can read anyone's mind he chooses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.51,0:16:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who tries to oppose\Nhim must use extreme caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:16:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:17:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to know an awful\Nlot about that eye, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing I don't know is if any\Nmere mortal can stand against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.01,0:17:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, there's no one else who\Ncan save Grandpa and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,With the secret staircase and all, they've\Ngot to be hiding something down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.67,0:17:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this is like the\Nmost boring detail ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what's the point\Nof guarding this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Without his soul, he's a total zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a waste of time. Wanna bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.19,0:17:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.73,0:17:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And the victory goes to Sir Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been a breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what the odds, I will\Nnever surrender to you, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I play one monster in\Ndefense mode and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, do your worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.37,0:18:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We've detected a potential\Nproblem in Sector 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm attempting to verify, but\Nour guard down there won't reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There appears to be a breach,\Nand there could be an intruder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.07,0:18:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Pegasus asked to be notified\Nimmediately should anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.37,0:18:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Pegasus is currently dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.71,0:18:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are your orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, secure all the exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.57,0:18:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy must not be freed. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.59,0:18:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's won this yet, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Stairwell's closed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.25,0:18:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.53,0:18:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they must be on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be my turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sleazeball\Ngonna pull this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.99,0:19:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the moment you've\Nall been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.61,0:19:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,First, re-ran in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly what you\Nwere expecting, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I switched the archery\Ngirl to defense mode too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, another dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This way's no good either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere else to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.39,0:19:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll scramble your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the best you've\Ngot, I'll still defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.59,0:19:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, so full of banter at\Nthis time of dire peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.77,0:19:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he needs another\Ndemonstration of my millennium magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:20:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,First, let's read your mind\Nand see what's in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, nice cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.55,0:20:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what are you going to draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Could the card you just\Ndrew be Summoned Skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.81,0:20:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the Summoned Skull will go\Nvery nicely with your Celtic Guardian,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Spellbinding Circle,\NMagical Hats, and Hornim.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.95,0:20:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's reading all of Yugi's cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.17,0:20:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him psych you out, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can still beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.11,0:20:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows all my cards\Nthe instant I draw them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,With that millennium eye\Nof his, he's unstoppable.
